# skills, and .claude/worktrees/: agent scratch checkouts that were measured at 332 MB
# across 1352 files, including the models/*.npz packs this file deliberately excludes
# elsewhere. Committing that would smuggle the ignored artifacts in by another path and
# put a third of a gigabyte into history permanently.
.claude/

